# Vercel Blob Storage Configuration
#
# 1. In Vercel dashboard: Storage → Create → Blob → Connect to your project
#    This auto-adds BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN to your project env vars.
#
# 2. (Optional) Set a CMS secret to protect write access:
#    Add CMS_SECRET in Vercel env vars (server-side)
#    Set VITE_CMS_SECRET below (client-side, for teacher CMS)

# Optional: Secret token for teacher CMS write access
# Must match CMS_SECRET set in Vercel environment variables
VITE_CMS_SECRET=

# ---- Legacy (no longer used) ----
# VITE_GIST_ID=
# VITE_GIST_TOKEN=
# VITE_GIST_OWNER=
